---
---
<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="features" id="features">
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="sec-head" data-reveal>
    <h2>Olvidate del papel, <br/>ahora <span class="hl">registramos acá todo lo que necesitas.</span></h2>
  </header>

  <div class="fcards">

    <!-- ── Fiados ── -->
    <article class="fcard" data-reveal>
      <div class="fcard-vis" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="fa2-wrap">
          <div class="fa2-hd">
            <span class="fa2-title">Cuentas corrientes</span>
            <span class="fa2-total">$23.700 pendiente</span>
          </div>
          <div class="fa2-rows">
            <div class="fa2-row" style="--i:0">
              <div class="fa2-av" style="--c:#3B7A57">M</div>
              <div class="fa2-info"><strong>Marcela R.</strong><small>hace 5 días</small></div>
              <span class="fa2-amt">$8.200</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fa2-row" style="--i:1">
              <div class="fa2-av" style="--c:#2D5A8E">J</div>
              <div class="fa2-info"><strong>Don Julio</strong><small>hace 2 días</small></div>
              <span class="fa2-amt">$3.500</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fa2-row fa2-row--due" style="--i:2">
              <div class="fa2-av fa2-av--due">K</div>
              <div class="fa2-info"><strong>Mayorista</strong><small class="fa2-due-lbl">Vencida · 2 días</small></div>
              <div class="fa2-row-end">
                <span class="fa2-amt fa2-amt--due">$12.000</span>
                <span class="fa2-cta-btn">Pagar</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fa2-footer">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M13 3H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h10a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1z"/><path d="M5 10v2M11 10v2"/></svg>
            Recordatorios de cobro automáticos
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fcard-text">
        <span class="fcard-label">Fiados</span>
        <h3>Los fiados, pagarés<br/>y demás, al día.</h3>
        <p>Sin traspapeleo ni borrones. mipos lleva las cuentas de cada cliente y avisa cuándo cobrar.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ── Stock ── -->
    <article class="fcard" data-reveal>
      <div class="fcard-vis" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="stk-wrap">
          <div class="stk-hd">
            <span>Stock actual</span>
            <span class="stk-alert-badge">1 producto bajo</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="stk-list">
            <li class="stk-row" style="--i:0">
              <img class="stk-thumb" src="/images/products/coca-cola.jpg" alt="Coca Cola" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="stk-meta">
                <span class="stk-name">Coca Cola</span>
                <div class="stk-track"><div class="stk-fill" style="--w:82%"></div></div>
              </div>
              <span class="stk-qty">82u</span>
            </li>
            <li class="stk-row stk-row--low" style="--i:1">
              <img class="stk-thumb" src="/images/products/leche.jpg" alt="Leche" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="stk-meta">
                <span class="stk-name">Leche <em class="stk-low-tag">bajo</em></span>
                <div class="stk-track"><div class="stk-fill stk-fill--low" style="--w:18%"></div></div>
              </div>
              <span class="stk-qty stk-qty--low">18u</span>
            </li>
            <li class="stk-row" style="--i:2">
              <img class="stk-thumb" src="/images/products/alfajor.jpg" alt="Alfajor" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="stk-meta">
                <span class="stk-name">Alfajor</span>
                <div class="stk-track"><div class="stk-fill" style="--w:58%"></div></div>
              </div>
              <span class="stk-qty">58u</span>
            </li>
            <li class="stk-row" style="--i:3">
              <img class="stk-thumb" src="/images/products/agua.jpg" alt="Agua" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="stk-meta">
                <span class="stk-name">Agua</span>
                <div class="stk-track"><div class="stk-fill" style="--w:44%"></div></div>
              </div>
              <span class="stk-qty">44u</span>
            </li>
            <li class="stk-row" style="--i:4">
              <img class="stk-thumb" src="/images/products/red-bull.jpg" alt="Red Bull" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="stk-meta">
                <span class="stk-name">Red Bull</span>
                <div class="stk-track"><div class="stk-fill" style="--w:71%"></div></div>
              </div>
              <span class="stk-qty">71u</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="stk-notify">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M8 1.5 1.5 13h13L8 1.5z"/><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="8" y2="9"/><circle cx="8" cy="11.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
            <span>Leche entera — stock mínimo</span>
            <span class="stk-reponer">Reponer</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fcard-text">
        <span class="fcard-label">Inventario</span>
        <h3>Stock en tiempo real,<br/>sin planillas.</h3>
        <p>Se descuenta solo con cada venta. Te avisa qué reponer antes de quedarte sin nada.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>

</div>
</section>

<style>
/* ── Section ── */
.features { padding: clamp(64px,8vw,104px) 0; }

/* ── Header ── */
.features .sec-head { text-align:center; margin-bottom: clamp(40px,5vw,60px); }

/* ── Cards grid — 3 columnas iguales ── */
.fcards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: clamp(14px,1.5vw,20px);
  align-items: stretch;
}

/* ── Card base ── */
.fcard {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--r-lg);
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--surface);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: box-shadow .22s, border-color .22s, transform .22s;
}
.fcard:hover {
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  border-color: var(--line-strong);
  transform: translateY(-3px);
}

/* ── Illustration area ── */
.fcard-vis {
  padding: clamp(24px,3vw,32px);
  background: var(--panel);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  flex: 1;
  min-height: clamp(220px,24vw,300px);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}


/* ── Text area ── */
.fcard-text {
  padding: clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}

.fcard-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--brand);
}

.fcard-text h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(18px,1.7vw,22px);
  font-weight: 780;
  line-height: 1.18;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0;
}

.fcard-text p {
  font-size: clamp(14px,1.05vw,15.5px);
  color: var(--ink-2);
  line-height: 1.62;
  margin: 0;
}

/* ─────────────────────────────────────────
   FIADOS ILLUSTRATION
───────────────────────────────────────── */
.fa2-wrap { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; }
.fa2-hd { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
.fa2-title { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); }
.fa2-total { font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink-2); background:var(--surface); padding:3px 10px; border-radius:99px; border:1px solid var(--line); }
.fa2-rows { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2px; }
.fa2-row {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  padding:10px 12px; border-radius:10px;
  background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--line-2);
  opacity:0; transform:translateX(12px);
  transition:opacity 380ms ease, transform 380ms ease;
  transition-delay: calc(var(--i) * 110ms + 160ms);
}
.is-in .fa2-row { opacity:1; transform:none; }
.fa2-row--due { border-color:rgba(239,68,68,.25); background:rgba(239,68,68,.04); }
.fa2-av {
  width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--c,var(--brand));
  display:grid; place-items:center;
  font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#fff;
  flex-shrink:0;
}
.fa2-av--due { background:#dc2626; }
.fa2-info { flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1px; }
.fa2-info strong { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); }
.fa2-info small { font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-3); }
.fa2-due-lbl { color:#dc2626 !important; }
.fa2-row-end { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
.fa2-amt { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); white-space:nowrap; }
.fa2-amt--due { color:#dc2626; }
.fa2-cta-btn {
  font-size:11px; font-weight:700;
  background:var(--brand); color:#fff;
  padding:3px 10px; border-radius:6px;
}
.fa2-footer {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px;
  font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-3);
  padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--line-2);
}
.fa2-footer svg { width:14px; height:14px; flex-shrink:0; }


/* ─────────────────────────────────────────
   STOCK ILLUSTRATION
───────────────────────────────────────── */
.stk-wrap { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; }
.stk-hd { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; }
.stk-hd span:first-child { font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); }
.stk-alert-badge {
  font-size:11px; font-weight:700; color:#dc2626;
  background:rgba(220,38,38,.08); border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.2);
  padding:3px 10px; border-radius:99px;
}
.stk-list { list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; }
.stk-row {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  opacity:0; transform:translateX(-8px);
  animation:stk-slide 400ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1) both;
  animation-delay:calc(60ms + var(--i)*55ms);
  animation-play-state:paused;
}
.is-in .stk-row { animation-play-state:running; }
@keyframes stk-slide { to { opacity:1; transform:none; } }
.stk-thumb {
  width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:8px; flex-shrink:0;
  object-fit:cover;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  display:block;
}
.stk-meta { flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; min-width:0; }
.stk-name { font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
.stk-low-tag { font-style:normal; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; color:#ef4444; background:rgba(239,68,68,.1); padding:1px 5px; border-radius:4px; }
.stk-track { height:4px; border-radius:2px; background:var(--line); overflow:hidden; }
.stk-fill {
  height:100%; border-radius:2px; width:var(--w);
  background:var(--brand);
  animation:stk-expand 500ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1) both;
  animation-delay:calc(80ms + var(--i,0)*55ms);
  animation-play-state:paused;
}
.stk-fill--low { background:#ef4444; }
.is-in .stk-fill { animation-play-state:running; }
@keyframes stk-expand { from { width:0; } }
.stk-qty { font-size:11px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink-3); width:26px; text-align:right; flex-shrink:0; }
.stk-qty--low { color:#ef4444; }
.stk-notify {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  padding:10px 12px;
  background:rgba(239,68,68,.06); border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.2);
  border-radius:9px; font-size:12px; color:#dc2626;
  opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px);
  transition:opacity 400ms ease, transform 400ms ease;
  transition-delay:800ms;
}
.is-in .stk-notify { opacity:1; transform:none; }
.stk-notify svg { width:14px; height:14px; flex-shrink:0; }
.stk-notify span:nth-child(2) { flex:1; }
.stk-reponer {
  font-weight:700; color:#dc2626;
  border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.4); padding:2px 10px; border-radius:6px;
  white-space:nowrap; flex-shrink:0;
}

/* ── Responsive ── */
@media (max-width:700px) {
  .fcards { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .fcard:hover { transform:none; }
}
@media (max-width:560px) {
  .fcards { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .fcard:last-child { grid-column:auto; }
}

/* ── Reduced motion ── */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  .fcard { transition:none; }
  .fa2-row { transition:none !important; opacity:1 !important; transform:none !important; }
  .stk-notify { transition:none !important; opacity:1 !important; transform:none !important; }
  .stk-row { animation:none !important; opacity:1 !important; transform:none !important; }
  .stk-fill { animation:none !important; }
}
</style>
